    <bpmn:startEvent id="Start_40" name="Owner opens product costing and pricing">
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_1</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:startEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Load_40" name="Load product, recipe, costs and pricing settings">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-01. Authorized Owner page access is established before entry. Load applicable product variant/configuration, existing final price, saved ingredient/packaging quantities/costs, general overhead/override and markup. Missing costing inputs are not an access failure and proceed to Unavailable evaluation.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_1</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_2</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Allowed_40" name="Selected product available?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_2</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_3</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_5</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Denied_40" name="Explain why the product is unavailable">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_37</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_3</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_4</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="DeniedEnd_40" name="Review unavailable; no changes">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_4</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="Inputs_40" name="Review or change overhead and markup settings">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-05-08. Select target and choose applicable overhead override or default, with Owner-confirmed optional markup/general default changes. No changes are required just to view costs. Recipe changes belong to BPMN-39; missing cost sources to appropriate inventory process. Cancel/stopping supported. Do not invent a fixed allowed markup list merely because preview has a dropdown.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_36</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_19</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_5</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_6</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Submit_40" name="Continue with these settings?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_6</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_7</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_8</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="Stop_40" name="Cancelled; final price unchanged">
      <bpmn:documentation>No final-price change. Any independently confirmed and successfully saved costing configuration remains saved; stopping later review does not undo that earlier explicit change.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_7</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Settings_40" name="Check and save submitted settings; choose overhead to use">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-05-08,14. Validate finite nonnegative markup/general overhead/override and valid target/Owner/current version. Persist confirmed changed settings consistently; no-op when retaining saved settings. A zero override is present, not missing. Choose override when configured, else general default. Recipe definition and inventory unit-cost modification remain their owning workflows. Settings save never modifies final price. Failed write leaves prior setting values intact; stale versions require current data review.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_8</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_9</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="SettingsSaved_40" name="Settings valid and any changes saved?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_9</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_10</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_11</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="SettingsError_40" name="Explain settings or save problem; keep unsaved changes">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_10</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_28</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="Costs_40" name="Check recipe amounts, material costs and overhead">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-02-04,07,18. Use current saved recipe/configuration and matching recorded inventory unit costs, including packaging. Require valid positive quantities and finite nonnegative costs and applicable overhead; distinguish recorded zero cost from absent/invalid cost. Missing required recipe/material/cost/overhead data cannot become zero. Applicable context quantities/variant/configuration scale the estimate; do not assume every historical transaction has one unit. No consumption or supplier purchase.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_11</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_12</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:businessRuleTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="CompleteData_40" name="All required cost inputs available and valid?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_12</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_13</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_14</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="Calculate_40" name="Calculate production cost, suggested price, profit and margin">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-02-04,09-10,16. Material cost = sum ingredient quantity × matching unit cost plus applicable packaging quantity × cost, with no double counting. Production cost C = materials + applicable utility overhead. Suggested price = C × (1 + markup/100), with consistent currency rounding. For actual selected/saved selling price P: estimated profit=P-C, margin=(P-C)/P×100 when P&gt;0. Exclude delivery, marketing and other costs outside defined production cost. Keep negative profit/margin visible; never clamp at zero or reject Owner price merely for being below estimate. Suggestion remains separate from final price.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_13</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_15</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:businessRuleTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Unavailable_40" name="Show missing inputs and mark estimates Unavailable">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-18. Show which inputs are absent/invalid; production-cost-based suggestion/profit/margin cannot be presented as reliable numbers where required data missing. Keep known existing final price visible and unchanged. Owner may repair recipe via BPMN-39 or cost source separately, then recalculate; do not invoke their full workflows automatically or invent zero values.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_14</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_16</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:userTask id="Review_40" name="Review results; keep or choose a final price, or change inputs">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-10-13,18. Present current cost breakdown, suggestion separately from saved final price and negative values/Unavailable flags. Owner chooses whether to retain final price, explicitly enter/approve a proposed final price (suggestion or another amount), or revise costing inputs. Reviewing a suggestion never implicitly saves it. Missing-cost warning does not establish a new prohibition on Owner price selection. Input repairs return through owning source processes where appropriate.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_32</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_16</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_15</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_17</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Choice_40" name="What does the Owner choose?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_17</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_18</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_19</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_20</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="Retained_40" name="Review complete; final price unchanged">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_18</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:businessRuleTask id="Price_40" name="Check chosen price is positive and reviewed data is current">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-01,11-13. Website P.setPrice requires finite positive price; validate supported currency precision/rounding and current target/permission/version. Do not require selected price to equal suggestion or exceed estimated cost. Recheck changed recipe/cost/overhead/markup context before save: stale context returns for explicit review/recalculation, not blind price write. Missing estimate remains disclosed. Existing order selling snapshots are not edited.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_20</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_21</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:businessRuleTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="PriceValid_40" name="Price valid and reviewed data still current?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_21</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_22</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_23</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="PriceError_40" name="Explain invalid price or changed data; keep unsaved price">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_22</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_29</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Save_40" name="Save Owner-selected final price separately from suggestion">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-11-13; NFR-REL-03,05-06. Protected version-checked consistent write saves only the explicitly reviewed selected final price and updated version. Reuse matching known saved operation result when safely identified; do not overwrite newer independent data. Failure preserves prior final price. Current recipe/stock costs may change estimates, not actual historical selling amounts, subscription apportionment or owner percentages. No automatic acceptance or financial payout.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_23</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_24</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Saved_40" name="Final price saved?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_24</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_25</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_26</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="SaveError_40" name="Explain save failure or conflicting change; keep unsaved price">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_25</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_30</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Expose_40" name="Show saved price; make cost estimates available to analytics">
      <bpmn:documentation>FR-PRICE-14-18. Refresh saved final catalog price via BPMN-37 consumers. Make current recipe/ingredient/packaging/overhead production-cost estimates available to BPMN-43 with applicable variant/quantity/configuration, including Unavailable and negative values. Estimates for earlier transactions may change with current source costs; original product consideration and Owner percentages stay preserved. No report generation, payment, payout or sale is created by this task.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_26</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_27</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="End_40" name="Final price saved; estimates available to analytics">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_27</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:userTask id="RecoveryReview_40" name="Review problem; correct inputs, reload data, or stop">
      <bpmn:documentation>Recoverable settings/price/save errors retain drafts and current saved values. Invalid selections can be corrected; stale context must be refreshed/recalculated and explicitly reviewed before final-price confirmation. Same saved operation cannot create duplicate writes. Permission loss cannot be bypassed. No implicit final-price approval during retry.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_30</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_29</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_28</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_31</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:userTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="Recovery_40" name="How does the Owner want to proceed?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_31</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_32</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_33</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_34</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
    <bpmn:endEvent id="StopRecovery_40" name="Stopped; saved values unchanged">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_33</bpmn:incoming>
    </bpmn:endEvent>
    <bpmn:serviceTask id="Reload_40" name="Load latest costs and settings; keep unsaved changes separately">
      <bpmn:documentation>Reload selected target and current recipe/cost/settings versions. Protected requests enforce permissions automatically, without another access decision or compulsory login. Preserve draft separately; invalidate stale estimate/review context, then return directly to input review for recalculation. An unavailable product ends this review with an explanation and no changes.</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_34</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_35</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:serviceTask>
    <bpmn:exclusiveGateway id="RetryAllowed_40" name="Selected product still available?">
      <bpmn:incoming>Flow_40_35</bpmn:incoming>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_36</bpmn:outgoing>
      <bpmn:outgoing>Flow_40_37</bpmn:outgoing>
    </bpmn:exclusiveGateway>
